 "report": {
  "translator_summary": "Nadesico moves toward the Mars ruins under heavy fire while Yurika announces her self-destruct plan; Inez explains the ruins' power to rewrite history by undoing all Boson Jumps across time. Ruri passionately objects, valuing her hard-won personal memories on the Nadesico above erasing history, leading Akito and Yurika to decide to banish the ruins to the ends of space instead. As Nadesico begins core recovery, Inez asserts that jumping the core requires mucous membrane contact between Yurika and Akito, teleporting Akito into Yurika's cockpit and causing a loud lover's spat that Ruri calmly notes is being broadcast live to both fleets.",
  "rows_examined": "op19_02 (brief63120#7-13, m6193#0-4), op19_03 (m6193#5-85), op19_04 (m6193#86-97)",
